abstract: >-
  An early working demo: a read-only explorer for bounded evidence and
  assumption provenance graphs beneath three pilot physics claims. AI-assisted
  prototype; human validation is pending. The code is MIT licensed; the derived
  graph data in data/ is CC BY 4.0.
